  - title: "X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a m\u1EDBi"
    titleVN: "X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a m\u1EDBi"
    contentVN: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc C\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng Th\xE1ng T\xE1m 1945 (8/1943), H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh quan t\xE2m x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a d\xE2n t\u1ED9c v\u1EDBi n\u0103m n\u1ED9i dung: x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng t\xE2m l\xFD (tinh th\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp t\u1EF1 c\u01B0\u1EDDng), lu\xE2n l\xFD (bi\u1EBFt hy sinh m\xECnh, l\xE0m l\u1EE3i cho qu\u1EA7n ch\xFAng), x\xE3 h\u1ED9i, ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB (d\xE2n quy\u1EC1n) v\xE0 kinh t\u1EBF.\n\nTrong kh\xE1ng chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng th\u1EF1c d\xE2n Ph\xE1p, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1ECBnh l\u1EA1i quan \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA3ng t\u1EEB \u0110\u1EC1 c\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u0103n h\xF3a Vi\u1EC7t Nam (1943): n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a m\u1EDBi c\xF3 t\xEDnh ch\u1EA5t d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, khoa h\u1ECDc, \u0111\u1EA1i ch\xFAng.\n\nTrong th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a x\xE3 h\u1ED9i, ch\u1EE7 tr\u01B0\u01A1ng x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a c\xF3 n\u1ED9i dung x\xE3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a v\xE0 t\xEDnh ch\u1EA5t d\xE2n t\u1ED9c. T\xF3m l\u1EA1i, \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a to\xE0n di\u1EC7n, gi\u1EEF g\xECn c\u1ED1t c\xE1ch d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m t\xEDnh khoa h\u1ECDc, ti\u1EBFn b\u1ED9 v\xE0 nh\xE2n v\u0103n. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.217-218)"
    exampleVN: 
    takeawayVN: "Ba giai \u0111o\u1EA1n: n\u0103m n\u1ED9i dung (1943); d\xE2n t\u1ED9c - khoa h\u1ECDc - \u0111\u1EA1i ch\xFAng; n\u1ED9i dung x\xE3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a v\xE0 t\xEDnh ch\u1EA5t d\xE2n t\u1ED9c."
    content: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc C\xE1ch m\u1EA1ng Th\xE1ng T\xE1m 1945 (8/1943), H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh quan t\xE2m x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a d\xE2n t\u1ED9c v\u1EDBi n\u0103m n\u1ED9i dung: x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng t\xE2m l\xFD (tinh th\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp t\u1EF1 c\u01B0\u1EDDng), lu\xE2n l\xFD (bi\u1EBFt hy sinh m\xECnh, l\xE0m l\u1EE3i cho qu\u1EA7n ch\xFAng), x\xE3 h\u1ED9i, ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB (d\xE2n quy\u1EC1n) v\xE0 kinh t\u1EBF.\n\nTrong kh\xE1ng chi\u1EBFn ch\u1ED1ng th\u1EF1c d\xE2n Ph\xE1p, Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1ECBnh l\u1EA1i quan \u0111i\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA3ng t\u1EEB \u0110\u1EC1 c\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u0103n h\xF3a Vi\u1EC7t Nam (1943): n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a m\u1EDBi c\xF3 t\xEDnh ch\u1EA5t d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, khoa h\u1ECDc, \u0111\u1EA1i ch\xFAng.\n\nTrong th\u1EDDi k\u1EF3 x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a x\xE3 h\u1ED9i, ch\u1EE7 tr\u01B0\u01A1ng x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a c\xF3 n\u1ED9i dung x\xE3 h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE7 ngh\u0129a v\xE0 t\xEDnh ch\u1EA5t d\xE2n t\u1ED9c. T\xF3m l\u1EA1i, \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a to\xE0n di\u1EC7n, gi\u1EEF g\xECn c\u1ED1t c\xE1ch d\xE2n t\u1ED9c, b\u1EA3o \u0111\u1EA3m t\xEDnh khoa h\u1ECDc, ti\u1EBFn b\u1ED9 v\xE0 nh\xE2n v\u0103n. (Gi\xE1o tr\xECnh 2021, tr.217-218)"
